      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I just love testing out battle strategies against\nother Z-A Royale Trainers, let me tell you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kinda weird to see a kid like you holding their\nown in such an intense contest, though.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe too many green newbies are joining in,\nmaking it easy to sail through the lower ranks?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm... I’m thinking there’s only one way to know\nwhether you’ve earned your place in the Royale.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThat’s right! Face me in battle, and I’ll give you\na taste of my latest and greatest strategy!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 198
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Talk to me again when you’re ready to face off!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061006C006B00200074006F0020006D006500200061006700610069006E0020007700680065006E00200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F002000660061006300650020006F006600660021001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you ready to go up against my awesome\nbattle tactics?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F007500200072006500610064007900200074006F00200067006F00200075007000200061006700610069006E007300740020006D007900200061007700650073006F006D0065000A0062006100740074006C006500200074006100630074006900630073003F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll take you on!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000740061006B006500200079006F00750020006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll pass, thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200070006100730073002C0020007400680061006E006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?! But Trainers in the Royale love to battle!\nWhy should you be any different?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here’s a heads-up for you—there’s more to going\non the offensive than just dealing damage!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re about to see what Pokémon can do when\nthey go into battle armed with Berries!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t believe my Berry-based strategy failed...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhen you have your Pokémon hold an item in\nbattle, it can trigger all sorts of effects, you know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll award you some Oran Berries for your troubles\ntoday, so give ’em a try!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
