      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If a Pokémon is holding an Oran Berry in battle\nand its health drops below half, it can eat the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nBerry to recover some HP.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
